schema: design.v1
name: bolttorrent
version: 1.0.0
status: bootstrap
description: BoltTorrent — self-hosted web torrent client with a dark, precise SaaS landing + dashboard. Cyan brand, single dark theme, Space Grotesk + Inter.

agent:
  skill: design
  instructions: |
    READ
    - Load this file before any UI generation or restyle for this project.
    - Order: overview/intent -> constraints -> tokens -> voice -> components -> locked.

    FOLLOW (generate or edit UI)
    - Single dark theme (themes.single) — do not invent a light mode.
    - Bind tokens; never hardcode hex/spacing/radius where a token exists.
    - Concentrate boldness in the hero swarm visual (intent.signature); keep the rest quiet.
    - Icons are inline SVG, stroke ~1.75, harmonious with 14-16px UI text — never emoji as icons/bullets.
    - Buttons: one filled primary per view; ghost + danger for the rest.
    - All interactive targets >= 44px on touch, >= 40px desktop.
    - No gradients except the single soft radial glow behind the hero visual.
    - Responsive: breakpoints at 900px and 640px; inputs >= 16px font on small screens.
    - Focus-visible ring in cyan, never bare outline:none.

    UPDATE
    - Edit in place; bump version.

    VERIFY
    - Tokens <-> CSS custom properties in static/index.html must match.

    PRECEDENCE
    1) User prompt 2) This file 3) design skill 4) Model defaults

    NEVER
    - Gradients beyond the hero glow
    - Glassmorphism
    - Emoji as icons
    - Off-system fonts
    - Emulate the "default AI" catalogue (purple-blue hero, acid accents, uniform rounded cards, everything centered)

overview: |
  A web torrent client as a polished SaaS surface. The mark framed a working product,
  not a movie poster: real live data (progress, speeds, peers) rendered with craft.

intent:
  reference: "Linear meets a networking console — precise dark surfaces, one cyan accent, live-data sincerity"
  direction: editorial-precise
  signature: "A live animated swarm visual in the hero: nodes drifting and linking, with real session numbers"
  treatment: editorial
  density: comfortable
  trust: high

voice:
  register: "Confident, precise, no hype. Short imperatives; sentence case."
  errors: "Say what happened and the next step."

themes:
  single: dark

tokens:
  color:
    ground: "#070B12"
    surface: "#0D131C"
    surface-2: "#121A26"
    border: "rgba(148,163,184,0.10)"
    border-strong: "rgba(148,163,184,0.16)"
    text: "#E8EEF7"
    muted: "#9AA7B8"
    accent: "#38BDF8"
    accent-strong: "#0EA5E9"
    on-accent: "#04121B"
    success: "#4ADE80"
    danger: "#F87171"
    warning: "#FBBF24"
  spacing:
    unit: 4
    sm: 8
    md: 16
    lg: 24
    xl: 40
    xxl: 64
  radius:
    sm: 8
    md: 12
    lg: 18
  typography:
    body:
      font: Inter
      size: 16
      weight: 400
      lh: 1.6
    body-sm:
      font: Inter
      size: 14
      weight: 400
    mono:
      font: "Space Grotesk"
      size: 14
      weight: 500
      feature: tabular
    display:
      font: "Space Grotesk"
      size: 48
      weight: 700
      lh: 1.05
      tracking: -0.02em
    heading:
      font: "Space Grotesk"
      size: 24
      weight: 700
      lh: 1.15
  motion:
    hover: "150ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1)"
    panel: "240ms cubic-bezier(0.32, 0.72, 0, 1)"

components:
  button:
    variants: [filled, ghost, danger]
    size:
      touch: "padding 12px 18px; min-height 44px"
      desktop: "padding 10px 16px; min-height 40px"
    tokens:
      filled:
        bg: "{tokens.color.accent-strong}"
        fg: "{tokens.color.on-accent}"
        hover-bg: "#0C94D3"
      ghost:
        bg: "{tokens.color.surface-2}"
        fg: "{tokens.color.text}"
        border: "{tokens.color.border}"
      danger:
        bg: "transparent"
        fg: "{tokens.color.danger}"
        border: "rgba(248,113,113,0.25)"
  card:
    bg: "{tokens.color.surface}"
    border: "{tokens.color.border}"
    radius: "{tokens.color.radius.lg if false else tokens.radius.md}"
  input:
    bg: "{tokens.color.ground}"
    border: "{tokens.color.border-strong}"
    focus-ring: "{tokens.color.accent}"
    radius: "{tokens.radius.md}"
  progress:
    track: "{tokens.color.surface-2}"
    fill: "{tokens.color.success}"

rationale:
  overview: |
    Dark and precise to make live numeric data feel trustworthy — the product's own output
    is the decoration. Cyan carries action and data highlights; green is reserved for
    progress/health so it never collides with the brand hue. The single hero glow + swarm
    visual is where boldness lives; everything else stays flat, quiet, and legible.

policy:
  if_missing: invent_with_note
  hierarchy: [typography, spacing, contrast, color]

constraints:
  always:
    - bind tokens to CSS custom properties
    - one filled primary per view
    - focus-visible cyan ring
    - responsive at 900px and 640px
  never:
    - gradients beyond the single hero glow
    - glassmorphism
    - emoji as icons or bullets
    - off-system fonts